<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE BEAT INDIA BY EIGHT WICKETS IN ONE-DAY MATCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE BEAT INDIA BY EIGHT WICKETS IN ONE-DAY MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO, Zimbabwe 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe beat India by eight wickets in the rain-affected first one-day international at Queens Sports Club on Saturday.</p>
<p>Zimbabwe were set a revised target of 136 in 38 overs.</p>
<p>Scores: India 168 in 43.5 overs, Zimbabwe 139 for two in 25.5 overs.</p>
</text>
